    "Startup falls back to an available built character when the original main pack is absent.",
    "Preview launcher explicitly disables the real Codex observer.",
    "Replace machine-specific and historical application documentation with portable instructions.",
    "Preserve original MIT software and separate artwork notices; include only two neutral effect PNGs.",
    "Normalize the main reference character directory, internal id, runtime defaults, build/profile/verification commands and documentation to ho-chan."
